      < 0.5) ? -2 :\n((c_AttackerMeleeAmount > 0 && c_AttackerIsShootOnMove < 0.5)
      ? -3 :\nMath.Max(0, \ni_SPD - c_AttackerWalkedDistance\n))))"
    instruction: "Type a mathematical expression using common '+', '-', '*', '/',
